# Moxa ioLogik E2260.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Moxa ioLogik E2260 Ethernet Remote I/O — 6-channel RTD + 4-channel DO + 6-channel Virtual RTD
# | 
# | Source: ioLogik E2200 Series User Manual Edition 7.0, September 2018 (Appendix I)
# | Protocol: Modbus/TCP port 502
# | 
# | RTD ch0-5 are physical; Virtual RTD ch6-11 are computed (AVG/DIV of physical channels)
# | FC03 (4xxxx R/W): DO + RTD configuration registers (primary space below)
# | FC04 (3xxxx R): RTD_value ch0-11 (0x0000-0x000B, unit 0.1),
# | RTD_minValue ch0-11 (0x000C-0x0017), RTD_maxValue ch0-11 (0x0018-0x0023)
# | FC01 (0xxxx R/W): DO bit ctrl ch0-3 (0x0000-0x000F), RTD reset-min (0x0010-0x001B),
# | RTD reset-max (0x001C-0x0027)
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Moxa
@model=ioLogik E2260
@vendor_website=moxa.com
@description=6-RTD + 4-DO + 6-virtual-RTD Modbus/TCP Ethernet remote I/O (port 502). FC03: DO_pulseOutputCount u32 hi+lo ch0-3 (0-7), DO_pulseLowWidth u32 hi+lo ch0-3 (8-15), DO_pulseHighWidth u32 hi+lo ch0-3 (16-23), DO_mode ch0-3 (24-27, 0=DO 1=Pulse), RTD_engineeringUnit ch0-5 (28-33, 0=Ohm 1=Celsius 2=Fahrenheit), VirtualRTD_engineeringUnit ch6-11 (34-39, 1=Celsius 2=Fahrenheit), RTD_sensorType ch0-5 (40-45, 0=PT50 1=PT100 2=PT200 3=PT500 4=PT1000 5=JPT100 6=JPT200 7=JPT500 8=JPT1000 9=NI100 10=NI200 11=NI500 12=NI1000 13=NI120 14=310ohm 15=620ohm 16=1250ohm 17=2500ohm), VirtualRTD_sensorType ch6-11 (46-51, 20=AVG 21=DIV), RTD_resetMinValue ch0-11 (52-63, W=1 to reset), RTD_resetMaxValue ch0-11 (64-75, W=1 to reset), DO_value ch0-3 (76-79, 0=OFF 1=ON), DO_powerOnStatus ch0-3 (80-83), DO_safeStatus ch0-3 (84-87), DO_pulseOutputStatus ch0-3 (88-91), DO_powerOnPulseStatus ch0-3 (92-95), DO_safeModePulseStatus ch0-3 (96-99), RTD_enable ch0-5 (100-105, 0=Disable 1=Enable), IntReg00-23 working (0x0150-0x0167=336-359). FC04: RTD_value ch0-11 (0-11, unit 0.1), RTD_minValue (12-23), RTD_maxValue (24-35). FC01: DO bit ctrl ch0-3, RTD reset-min/max.
